# ==============================================================================
# REQUIRED ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (Google AI Studio Development)
# ==============================================================================
# The application requires ONLY these variables to run in Google AI Studio:
DATABASE_URL=
AUTH_SECRET=
MAP_PROVIDER_KEY=

# ==============================================================================
# OPTIONAL ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (Production Deployment Overrides)
# ==============================================================================
# These variables are strictly OPTIONAL and NOT required for AI Studio development:
#
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN: Optional Vercel Blob token for cloud object storage in production.
#                        When omitted, the app uses a labeled local disk storage fallback.
#
# WEATHER_PROVIDER_KEY:  Optional third-party weather API key.
#                        When omitted, the app uses the keyless real-time Open-Meteo provider.


